WEBVTT

00:01.100 --> 00:03.730
<b>5 Years Earlier</b>

00:06.460 --> 00:08.690
They say he can't use magic.

00:06.840 --> 00:11.490
<b>Will Serfort (10 years old)</b>

00:08.690 --> 00:11.690
People like him exist? 
I've never heard of that before.

00:11.690 --> 00:14.340
How did he get into the magical academy?

00:14.340 --> 00:18.780
Apparently, he was bait to lure 
Lady Elfaria to the school.

00:18.780 --> 00:21.200
Then we don't need him anymore, do we?

00:21.200 --> 00:24.520
Lady Elfaria has already become 
a Magia Vander, after all.

00:24.520 --> 00:26.580
He'll probably get kicked out.

00:38.890 --> 00:40.890
<b>Rigarden Magical Academy Professor
Workner Norgram</b>

00:40.890 --> 00:43.390
<b>Rigarden Magical Academy
Headmaster's Office</b>

00:43.390 --> 00:45.900
<b>Rigarden Magical Academy Headmaster
Caldron Anouve</b>

01:24.260 --> 01:26.460
Very well, Workner!

01:27.100 --> 01:30.440
I shall allow him to continue 
attending at the academy.

01:30.440 --> 01:33.050
A-Are you certain about this?

01:33.490 --> 01:36.070
Will is unable to use magic.

01:36.070 --> 01:39.450
Yes. After all, it's quite interesting

01:39.450 --> 01:42.580
for a sword to yearn to be a wand.

01:43.630 --> 01:45.330
If I study at this academy...

01:45.870 --> 01:48.080
will I be able to ascend the tower?

01:48.750 --> 01:49.960
If I'm strong...

01:50.360 --> 01:52.960
will I be able to go to Elfie?

01:52.960 --> 01:58.340
If you are unfailingly diligent and your 
will stands firm, as though undaunted,

01:58.620 --> 01:59.800
then perhaps.

02:12.050 --> 02:13.860
I'm sorry.

02:14.320 --> 02:17.740
But as you have no guardian, 
this falls on you, you understand?

02:19.410 --> 02:22.490
Imagine a sword aiming to become a wand...

02:23.010 --> 02:26.250
Now, how will this all turn out, I wonder?

04:05.840 --> 04:08.600
<b>Familiar
Kiki</b>

04:08.600 --> 04:10.350
When we say "ascend the tower,"

04:10.690 --> 04:13.960
we generally mean advancing 
to the Upper Institute.

04:14.530 --> 04:16.660
To become one of the Magia Vander

04:16.660 --> 04:19.690
who reign from the topmost floor 
of Mercedes Caulis,

04:19.690 --> 04:23.450
you must be recognized by the highest center
of learning. That is, the Upper Institute.

04:24.210 --> 04:27.120
There are two principal methods 
of advancement.

04:27.530 --> 04:30.150
The first is to create a new type of magic.

04:30.150 --> 04:34.590
The second is to earn at least 
seventy-two hundred credits at our academy.

04:34.590 --> 04:38.000
Only a limited number of people
can achieve the former.

04:38.820 --> 04:42.760
Which means that the majority of students 
must rely on the latter.

04:42.760 --> 04:43.750
However...

04:45.010 --> 04:48.500
Everyone here is in danger
of not making graduation,

04:48.500 --> 04:50.890
much less the Upper Institute!

04:51.230 --> 04:54.180
So today, I will thoroughly drill you
in supplementary lessons!

04:54.180 --> 04:55.640
Sob, sob...

05:01.150 --> 05:05.540
I heard that Professor Workner's 
supplemental class was unreal again.

05:02.210 --> 05:06.860
<b>Rigarden Magical Academy Student, Sixth Year
Colette Loire</b>

05:05.540 --> 05:06.790
Yeah.

05:06.790 --> 05:10.620
We did everything from consecutive 
mock exams to rigorous magic instruction.

05:10.620 --> 05:13.690
Will, you've already earned 
every possible writing credit.

05:13.690 --> 05:16.210
Professor Workner can be
 too strict sometimes.

05:16.490 --> 05:19.200
It's because I've completely failed spellwork.

05:19.200 --> 05:22.490
But being a failure doesn't mean 
I shouldn't work hard.

05:23.100 --> 05:27.790
Besides, Professor Workner is kind
to give us supplementary lessons at all.

05:27.790 --> 05:31.350
Most professors wouldn't give us 
a second thought.

05:31.700 --> 05:32.970
That's true.

05:32.970 --> 05:37.350
Professor Edward in particular doesn't seem
like he'd ever bother with extra classes.

05:41.110 --> 05:43.010
I'm telling you, it's true!

05:43.010 --> 05:45.490
Sion defeated an Evil Sentinel!

05:45.760 --> 05:47.680
A monster worth ten credits?

05:46.800 --> 05:49.870
<b>Rigarden Magical Academy Student, Sixth Year
Gordon Baret</b>

05:47.680 --> 05:49.870
By himself? Really?

05:49.870 --> 05:50.810
Yes!

05:50.740 --> 05:53.740
<b>Rigarden Magical Academy Student, Sixth Year
Lyril Marze</b>

05:50.810 --> 05:52.930
It overwhelmed us immediately,

05:52.930 --> 05:56.110
but when we woke, 
Sion had slain the Sentinel!

05:56.110 --> 05:58.050
This'll increase Sion's standing.

05:58.050 --> 06:00.330
He'll probably replace one
of the Top Three soon.

06:00.330 --> 06:01.950
That's Lord Sion for you!

06:01.250 --> 06:04.000
<b>Rigarden Magical Academy Student, Sixth Year
Sion Ulster</b>

06:03.020 --> 06:04.000
<i>You're wrong.</i>

06:05.710 --> 06:06.920
<i>The truth is that...</i>

06:20.120 --> 06:21.900
This must be some kind of joke.

06:22.260 --> 06:24.150
You're talentless, and yet...

06:25.780 --> 06:28.280
Stop, Sion! Why are you doing this again?

06:28.280 --> 06:29.780
What are you trying to accomplish?

06:40.580 --> 06:42.510
H-Hey, Sion!

06:43.290 --> 06:44.740
What was that about?

06:45.510 --> 06:47.790
Will, did something happen between you two?

06:48.840 --> 06:51.600
Yeah. Nothing much, though.

06:53.160 --> 06:55.600
Will Serfort should be expelled!

06:55.850 --> 06:57.340
Headmistress Caldron!

06:57.870 --> 07:01.350
My, my. What's brought all this on?

07:01.350 --> 07:03.360
<b>Rigarden Magical Academy Professor
Edward Serfence</b>

07:01.620 --> 07:03.060
Edward.

07:03.360 --> 07:06.840
Will is already in his sixth 
and final year here.

07:06.840 --> 07:08.860
To expel him now when he's come this far...

07:08.860 --> 07:12.610
This academy has no need of anyone
who is a warrior and not a mage!

07:12.990 --> 07:16.990
Someone who can surpass magic 
without being able to use it?

07:22.230 --> 07:24.280
Will Serfort...

07:25.390 --> 07:28.030
He has good marks in writing.

07:28.030 --> 07:30.760
His reports have an interesting perspective.

07:31.010 --> 07:34.100
If we ignore the fact that he cannot use magic,

07:34.100 --> 07:37.300
he excels to the degree that calling it
mere excellence is insufficient.

07:37.300 --> 07:40.770
A Magia Vander aside, 
he could become an artificer or a healer.

07:40.770 --> 07:42.910
There are many paths open to him.

07:43.560 --> 07:48.530
This academy has a duty to produce 
learned scholars for the Fated Day.

07:48.990 --> 07:51.420
The boy in question doesn't seek
to be a learned scholar,

07:51.420 --> 07:54.780
but a Magia Vander. That's the issue here.

07:56.280 --> 07:59.370
Indeed, that is a problem.

08:00.290 --> 08:04.040
In that case, Edward, give him a test.

08:04.370 --> 08:08.410
And since you have now learned his secret,
I'll have you administer the test personally.

08:09.050 --> 08:12.370
Should he fail to find his way 
through your test,

08:12.370 --> 08:15.680
I shall entrust the matter of his 
advancement or expulsion to you.

08:17.050 --> 08:18.640
Are you certain?

08:19.060 --> 08:22.180
I am not as lenient as Workner is.

08:22.440 --> 08:26.690
That is no object. I'll leave 
the content of the test up to you.

08:31.560 --> 08:35.200
<i>Test him to your utmost and
 determine the truth for yourself.</i>

08:35.790 --> 08:40.630
<i>You understand the Magia Vander 
better than anyone, Dark Vipermage.</i>

08:48.800 --> 08:50.460
Sorry, Colette.

08:50.460 --> 08:53.590
I'm always coming to you for help
because I can't use magic.

08:53.590 --> 08:55.720
It's fine! This is nothing.

09:01.610 --> 09:03.560
You haven't changed, I see.

09:03.820 --> 09:07.500
Yeah. I'll never get permission 
to carry my sword on campus,

09:07.500 --> 09:11.440
and if I go back to the dorm,
my roommate never lets me leave.

09:11.740 --> 09:14.950
It's... Rosty, right?

09:15.770 --> 09:17.450
You must be really good friends.

09:19.320 --> 09:21.700
Just regular ones, I'd say.

09:21.700 --> 09:24.540
<b>Study Hall</b>

09:24.540 --> 09:29.170
In year 344 of the Magical Era, 
the Battle of Garzaronso broke out.

09:29.170 --> 09:34.040
The dwarves, a race from another world, 
were angered by exploitation, overwork,

09:34.040 --> 09:36.420
and worse treatment than the elves,

09:36.420 --> 09:37.660
also from another world.

09:37.660 --> 09:39.180
So they raised an army to wage war.

09:39.180 --> 09:42.880
Will, haven't you studied this already?

09:39.550 --> 09:42.880
The dwarf army numbered ten thousand.
 In comparison, the Tower had...

09:42.880 --> 09:45.060
Today, I'm reviewing
other races' perspectives.

09:45.360 --> 09:48.060
You're already incredible in writing, 
far better than me.

09:48.060 --> 09:50.190
You don't need to work so hard.

09:50.680 --> 09:54.820
If I lose even one credit, I won't be able 
to advance to the Upper Institute.

09:55.780 --> 10:00.820
Besides, I can understand how the dwarves felt.

10:02.530 --> 10:04.360
The Battle of Garzaronso...

10:05.400 --> 10:08.830
Even in the face of the mightiest magics,
 they continued to fight.

10:10.020 --> 10:11.830
"Never give up."

10:12.520 --> 10:14.840
Such determination can surpass even magic.

10:15.120 --> 10:17.160
Did you learn that from Professor Workner?

10:17.160 --> 10:19.860
Yes. I love that saying.

10:19.860 --> 10:21.540
It's why I have to do my very best.

10:23.410 --> 10:24.220
Oh, Will...

10:24.220 --> 10:25.600
You have a white hair.

10:25.600 --> 10:26.400
What?!

10:26.400 --> 10:28.730
I told you! You're working too hard!

10:30.570 --> 10:33.860
Sh-Shall I pull it out for you?

10:33.860 --> 10:36.360
N-No, I'm all right.

10:36.640 --> 10:38.240
I want to!

10:38.240 --> 10:39.500
Let me do it!

10:39.500 --> 10:40.610
Why?

10:40.610 --> 10:42.260
What is this commotion?

10:42.840 --> 10:44.620
Professor Edward!

10:44.900 --> 10:47.750
I-I'm sorry! We were studying.

10:50.280 --> 10:51.500
Serfort.

10:52.260 --> 10:54.780
Come to the Spellhall immediately. Alone.

10:52.460 --> 10:55.630
<b>Rigarden Magical Academy
Spellhall</b>

10:59.410 --> 11:02.050
As I cannot overlook how
you continue to fail spellwork,

11:02.050 --> 11:03.800
I'm giving you a supplemental lesson.

11:03.800 --> 11:05.140
I trust you're grateful.

11:05.630 --> 11:08.380
<i>You're</i> giving a supplemental 
lesson, Professor Edward?

11:08.380 --> 11:09.640
And one just for me?

11:10.070 --> 11:11.690
That's right.

11:11.690 --> 11:15.070
I will ascertain your worth myself.

11:22.410 --> 11:26.830
Your assignment is to land 
a single strike on me.

11:27.160 --> 11:29.100
Refusal is not an option.

11:29.100 --> 11:32.680
Should you succeed, 
I will award you five spellwork credits.

11:33.290 --> 11:37.960
However, should you fail, 
I will have you leave this academy.

11:37.960 --> 11:39.750
I-I'll be expelled?

11:40.380 --> 11:45.660
Those without talent should not be permitted 
to even look upon the Magia Vander.

11:47.010 --> 11:49.240
I've given you reason to fight.

11:49.640 --> 11:50.940
Let's begin.

11:57.190 --> 11:58.610
Ashwind Wand

11:57.270 --> 11:58.780
Crystal for monitoring Will

12:02.400 --> 12:03.610
Darkviper Wand

12:15.380 --> 12:17.290
You called for me, headmaster?

12:17.760 --> 12:21.870
I'm sorry to make you come
 all this way, Workner.

12:21.870 --> 12:22.740
Not at all.

12:23.690 --> 12:25.300
So, what did you need?

12:25.610 --> 12:28.480
I thought I should fill you in.

12:29.320 --> 12:30.810
<i>Clair Molda.</i>

12:37.630 --> 12:38.270
What?

12:38.840 --> 12:41.570
Will? And Ed?

12:41.860 --> 12:43.820
Wait a moment, please! What is this?

12:44.170 --> 12:45.420
Workner.

12:45.820 --> 12:49.430
Edward is currently conducting a test.

12:49.430 --> 12:52.330
You are forbidden from stopping him.

12:53.010 --> 12:56.940
Just as I have recognized your advocacy 
for Will, whom you have watched over,

12:56.940 --> 13:00.510
I must recognize Edward's concerns
 in equal measure.

13:00.510 --> 13:03.190
That is the decision I have made.

13:03.820 --> 13:10.100
I am having him ascertain whether Will is 
worthy of attempting to become a Magia Vander.

13:10.450 --> 13:11.530
This can't be...

13:12.550 --> 13:15.420
Why Professor Edward, of all people?

13:16.060 --> 13:18.000
This is just...

13:18.600 --> 13:20.110
It's just too cruel.

13:20.450 --> 13:21.980
Oh? And why is that?

13:22.270 --> 13:24.360
Why? Because he...

13:25.880 --> 13:28.930
He's the closest to actually 
becoming a Magia Vander!

13:28.930 --> 13:32.460
He may have been defeated, but he's an 
ascendant! He's reached the top of the tower!

13:33.160 --> 13:34.760
Dax Darbicans.

13:40.050 --> 13:41.990
<i>Dax Darbicans?</i>

13:41.990 --> 13:43.630
<i>That's a low-level dark magic spell.</i>

13:44.300 --> 13:46.030
<i>And yet look at this power!</i>

13:51.400 --> 13:52.140
Darge.

13:53.960 --> 13:56.140
<i>His defense is impregnable, too!</i>

13:56.890 --> 13:59.810
Kicking at a magical shield?

14:00.300 --> 14:02.770
You truly are hopeless.

14:13.810 --> 14:16.380
<i>He's casting his spells with no incantations.</i>

14:16.380 --> 14:18.170
<i>They activate so quickly!</i>

14:19.070 --> 14:21.420
<i>There's not one hole
in his offense or defense!</i>

14:24.900 --> 14:27.420
<i>I can't even scratch him!</i>

14:29.810 --> 14:31.430
He's so strong.

14:36.290 --> 14:38.630
Two, Serfort.

14:39.540 --> 14:43.320
The only magics I will use are my
 black flames to burn you

14:43.790 --> 14:47.320
and my shield to repel your 
unsightly savagery. Just those two.

14:47.910 --> 14:51.070
Magical Doctrine Number 27...

14:52.560 --> 14:55.330
You, who shall never attain
 a thousand magics,

14:55.710 --> 14:57.330
should strive to master a single one.

14:58.280 --> 15:00.990
It shall become as a thousand arrows for you.

15:01.720 --> 15:04.460
<i>He's overlapping a single spell?</i>

15:04.770 --> 15:06.210
<i>Is this a Series?</i>

15:06.460 --> 15:09.030
<i>He's going to fire a barrage of Dax Darbicans!</i>

15:11.900 --> 15:13.930
The talentless should simply disappear.

15:37.550 --> 15:38.840
<i>I can't beat him.</i>

15:40.190 --> 15:42.480
<i>So this is what a top-tier mage is like...</i>

15:42.870 --> 15:46.170
<i>If only I had my sword!</i>

15:53.180 --> 15:55.370
I wonder if Will is all right.

15:56.020 --> 16:00.020
<i>A solo supplemental lesson
 with Professor Edward?</i>

16:00.790 --> 16:03.770
<i>What if he's being lashed 
with a whip or tortured?</i>

16:05.580 --> 16:09.240
No!

16:06.540 --> 16:10.400
This is nice, isn't it? This is nice, isn't it?

16:17.960 --> 16:18.990
Kiki?

16:19.650 --> 16:21.450
Why are you injured like that?

16:24.730 --> 16:26.670
That's Will's...

16:26.670 --> 16:28.710
Don't tell me something's 
happened to Will!

16:43.050 --> 16:44.640
This goes without saying,

16:45.220 --> 16:49.360
but the Magia Vander are
 the pinnacle of all mages.

16:50.410 --> 16:53.010
If you cannot overcome someone like me,

16:53.010 --> 16:55.160
you have no chance to reach such heights.

16:56.940 --> 17:00.910
I will set you a question 
regarding the Battle of Garzaronso.

17:01.500 --> 17:06.670
The foolish dwarves incited a rebellion 
with a force of ten thousand.

17:08.250 --> 17:11.960
Now, how many mages 
did it take to quell the battle?

17:15.510 --> 17:16.740
One!

17:17.860 --> 17:22.200
With a wave of a wand, ten thousand 
dwarven warriors were annihilated!

17:22.200 --> 17:24.680
<i>That</i> is the way of this world!

17:24.680 --> 17:27.190
A sword will never reach a wand!

17:27.190 --> 17:28.380
Never!

17:29.810 --> 17:32.130
Abandon your foolish aspirations.

17:33.340 --> 17:34.810
Even so...

17:35.200 --> 17:37.700
Even so, I...

17:38.340 --> 17:41.260
I want to reach the Magia Vander!

17:47.390 --> 17:50.340
What is it that drives you so?

17:50.780 --> 17:55.310
Just what noble reason do you claim 
lives in that heart of yours?!

18:01.260 --> 18:03.790
I want to be with the person I love!

18:07.020 --> 18:07.980
What?

18:08.600 --> 18:12.900
I want to keep the promise I made with Elfie!

18:15.250 --> 18:17.240
What nonsense.

18:17.240 --> 18:19.730
Impure! Immoral! Foul!

18:19.730 --> 18:24.370
A foolish, pathetic, worldly love 
pushes you to reach for the apex of magic?

18:24.740 --> 18:30.210
Even if my reason seems ridiculous to you, 
and no matter how harsh my path may be...

18:30.210 --> 18:31.500
Have some sense of shame!

18:31.500 --> 18:32.630
In spite of it all...

18:32.630 --> 18:37.010
I will go and see the sunset with Elfie!

18:38.340 --> 18:41.760
Will!

18:44.340 --> 18:45.640
Thank you!

18:45.640 --> 18:46.810
All right!

18:54.600 --> 18:56.070
That isn't a wand...

18:56.500 --> 18:59.070
That's a sword in your hand, you deviant.

19:00.060 --> 19:01.320
I will defeat you!

19:09.560 --> 19:11.170
<i>He sliced through my magic?</i>

19:11.820 --> 19:13.540
<i>Is that a Moria blade?</i>

19:14.090 --> 19:15.000
<i>Nevertheless!</i>

19:16.680 --> 19:19.340
<i>Here it comes. Another magical barrage.</i>

19:19.800 --> 19:22.260
<i>I'm scared. I'm scared!</i>

19:22.260 --> 19:23.930
<i>I'll be burned again.</i>

19:23.930 --> 19:26.840
<i>It's a terrifying volley of a thousand flames.</i>

19:26.840 --> 19:28.640
<i>My arms and legs are shaking.</i>

19:28.640 --> 19:32.270
<i>This is the barrier between me 
and the Magia Vander!</i>

19:32.750 --> 19:34.770
<i>I want to run away!</i>

19:35.100 --> 19:36.020
<i>But...</i>

19:36.020 --> 19:38.360
<i>this is my only way through the barrier!</i>

19:38.610 --> 19:40.860
It's over!

19:42.650 --> 19:45.210
Will!

19:46.980 --> 19:50.000
<i>There's more to the story 
of the Battle of Garzaronso.</i>

19:52.370 --> 19:56.720
<i>A brave dwarven general named Gareth
 fought even as he lost all his brethren.</i>

19:57.380 --> 20:00.970
<i>And in spite of everything, 
he landed a single blow.</i>

20:02.650 --> 20:07.450
<i>In honor of his bravery, 
the mages recognized the dwarves' status.</i>

20:13.350 --> 20:14.230
<i>That's right!</i>

20:15.310 --> 20:17.070
<i>A sword saw a wand...</i>

20:17.540 --> 20:18.690
<i>and reached it!</i>

20:45.210 --> 20:49.030
Will Serfort, you are hereby
 awarded five credits.

20:49.470 --> 20:51.060
Will!

20:56.810 --> 20:59.430
Will? Will, are you all right?

21:00.860 --> 21:02.360
Well done!

21:07.170 --> 21:09.420
He chose to dive into the barrage.

21:10.090 --> 21:14.370
He hid himself and attacked 
from a blind spot overhead.

21:14.740 --> 21:19.500
Yes, and with a strike powerful enough 
to break through that shield.

21:19.500 --> 21:23.470
He can manage a slashing attack
capable of overcoming magic.

21:26.200 --> 21:29.190
It was truly as though he was undaunted.

23:01.560 --> 23:05.070
<b>Magical Academy Outskirts</b>

23:15.330 --> 23:16.830
Hup!

23:17.100 --> 23:19.830
And to finish it off, I'll add lots of love.

23:21.060 --> 23:22.220
Done!

23:24.280 --> 23:26.340
Will sure is late.

23:27.530 --> 23:29.600
I wonder if he'll be home soon.

23:37.620 --> 23:40.430
Next time on <i>Wistoria: Wand and Sword</i>,

23:40.430 --> 23:43.520
episode 3, "Order & Watcher."

23:41.640 --> 23:46.020
Episode 3
Order & Watcher
